    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/76d6da6b285cd92f8e40406663658c24.poster.avif?t=1726147536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/76d6da6b285cd92f8e40406663658c24.webm?t=1726147536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/76d6da6b285cd92f8e40406663658c24.mp4?t=1726147536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Get ready to blast your way to freedom in <strong>Boom Blaster</strong>, the ultimate platform combat adventure that will keep you hooked for hours on end! As a space prison inmate, your destiny is clear: kill every obstacle to earn your freedom.<br><br>Get ready to face a barrage of challenges, from tiny insects to massive bosses, but don't worry, you'll have a wide range of skills to resist and overpower them all. Each hero has unique strengths, so choose wisely to maximize your chances of success.<br><br>With an incredible array of weapons, including machine guns, grenades, lasers, flamethrowers, and rockets, you'll have everything you need to unleash explosive destruction and take down your enemies easily.<br><br>But the adventure doesn't end there - <strong>Boom Blaster </strong>also features thrilling rescue missions, including high-speed chases, intense flights, uncovering secret artifacts, and experiencing unexpected endings. And with an insane amount of content, you'll never run out of exciting challenges to tackle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/96c945449a8a2525cfa7b7a1c667f4aa.poster.avif?t=1726147536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/96c945449a8a2525cfa7b7a1c667f4aa.webm?t=1726147536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/96c945449a8a2525cfa7b7a1c667f4aa.mp4?t=1726147536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy hand-drawn graphics and detailed animations that bring the world of Boom Blaster to life.<br></li><li>Take on intense boss fights and challenging levels in this action-packed side-scrolling shooter.<br></li><li>Choose your hero wisely and use their unique abilities to your advantage in battle.<br></li><li>Unleash various powerful weapons, including machine guns, grenades, lasers, flamethrowers, and rockets.<br></li><li>Embark on exciting rescue missions, including chases, flights, and treasure hunts to uncover hidden artifacts and unexpected endings.</li></ul><br>Ready to embark on the journey of a lifetime and earn your freedom in <strong>Boom Blaster</strong>? Download the game now and let the blasting begin!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/76d6da6b285cd92f8e40406663658c24.poster.avif?t=1726147536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/76d6da6b285cd92f8e40406663658c24.webm?t=1726147536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/76d6da6b285cd92f8e40406663658c24.mp4?t=1726147536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Get ready to blast your way to freedom in <strong>Boom Blaster</strong>, the ultimate platform combat adventure that will keep you hooked for hours on end! As a space prison inmate, your destiny is clear: kill every obstacle to earn your freedom.<br><br>Get ready to face a barrage of challenges, from tiny insects to massive bosses, but don't worry, you'll have a wide range of skills to resist and overpower them all. Each hero has unique strengths, so choose wisely to maximize your chances of success.<br><br>With an incredible array of weapons, including machine guns, grenades, lasers, flamethrowers, and rockets, you'll have everything you need to unleash explosive destruction and take down your enemies easily.<br><br>But the adventure doesn't end there - <strong>Boom Blaster </strong>also features thrilling rescue missions, including high-speed chases, intense flights, uncovering secret artifacts, and experiencing unexpected endings. And with an insane amount of content, you'll never run out of exciting challenges to tackle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/96c945449a8a2525cfa7b7a1c667f4aa.poster.avif?t=1726147536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/96c945449a8a2525cfa7b7a1c667f4aa.webm?t=1726147536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246230/extras/96c945449a8a2525cfa7b7a1c667f4aa.mp4?t=1726147536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Featuring:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy hand-drawn graphics and detailed animations that bring the world of Boom Blaster to life.<br></li><li>Take on intense boss fights and challenging levels in this action-packed side-scrolling shooter.<br></li><li>Choose your hero wisely and use their unique abilities to your advantage in battle.<br></li><li>Unleash various powerful weapons, including machine guns, grenades, lasers, flamethrowers, and rockets.<br></li><li>Embark on exciting rescue missions, including chases, flights, and treasure hunts to uncover hidden artifacts and unexpected endings.</li></ul><br>Ready to embark on the journey of a lifetime and earn your freedom in <strong>Boom Blaster</strong>? Download the game now and let the blasting begin!<br><br>",
